<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>All I Did Was Dream of You (feat. The Marías)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">beabadoobee, The Marías</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">All I Did Was Dream of You (feat. The Marías)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0qWoOHqTirzo59FQ9eoECH</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.360" end="00:16.780">Please</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.780" end="00:22.460">All I did was dream of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.460" end="00:28.260">Swimming in my mind again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.260" end="00:36.260">Wanting to waste time again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.760" end="00:45.720">Always so easy with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.720" end="00:51.390">I don't have to think</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.390" end="00:59.280">Pour another drink</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.280" end="01:02.290">And I want it all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.290" end="01:05.190">While I'm yours and you are mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.190" end="01:07.710">Going steady till we lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.710" end="01:11.010">High at sunrise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.010" end="01:13.890">All I wanted was to see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.890" end="01:16.770">Everything you see in me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.770" end="01:19.670">Everything I wanna be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.670" end="01:21.540">High at sunrise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.540" end="01:29.540">Stay, stay or just leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.810" end="01:37.570">Stay or just leave me be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.570" end="01:45.570">Stay or just leave me be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.980" end="01:53.980">Nightmares always feel like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.330" end="01:59.700">They swallow me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.700" end="02:07.700">But I let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.210" end="02:17.210">Doesn't feel like I can breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.970" end="02:22.950">They follow me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.950" end="02:28.630">But I let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.630" end="02:31.760">Yeah I let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.760" end="02:34.660">And I want it all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.660" end="02:37.600">While im yours and you are mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.600" end="02:40.370">Going steady till we lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.370" end="02:43.330">High at sunrise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.330" end="02:46.160">All I wanted was to see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.160" end="02:48.990">Everything you see in me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.990" end="02:51.850">Everything I wanna be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.850" end="02:54.280">High at sunrise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.280" end="03:02.280">Stay, stay or just leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.140" end="03:10.290">Stay or just leave me be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.290" end="03:17.160">Stay or just leave me be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.160" end="03:21.940">Stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.940" end="03:28.230">Like the summer breeze</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:28.230" end="03:34.340">Don't go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.340" end="03:38.340">Don't go</p></div></body></tt>